WEBVTT

00:00:00.710 --> 00:00:02.190
I am Princess Layla.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.980
The King of Destruction is after this world.

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:06.400
"Invitation to the Unknown".

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:07.620
Now, let's go home!

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:08.600
Don't touch me, Clone!

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.410
Do you know what I have to go through every day?

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:14.810
Tonight may be the last time my little sister searches for her messiah.

00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:17.930
It seems this "Underworld" is a secret, members-only club.

00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:20.890
"Messiah" is probably their secret word for a member.

00:00:20.890 --> 00:00:22.630
Messiah-sama...

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:26.080
Nice lips.

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:27.000
What?!

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:14.010
It stinks!

00:02:14.010 --> 00:02:16.140
It's coming from your shoe locker, Nao-chin.

00:02:16.140 --> 00:02:17.530
What did you put in there?

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:19.200
Just my indoor shoes.

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:20.210
Are you sure?

00:02:20.210 --> 00:02:23.620
Just how badly do your feet stink?

00:02:25.790 --> 00:02:28.090
This isn't my foot odour!

00:02:28.090 --> 00:02:30.460
I'll open it.

00:02:32.920 --> 00:02:35.840
Wh-What is this?

00:02:37.210 --> 00:02:38.970
It's a rotten squid!

00:02:38.970 --> 00:02:40.590
Rotten squid, you say?

00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:49.230
A rotten squid and Clone-neesan...

00:02:50.110 --> 00:02:51.900
It's been an intense morning.

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:54.450
I wonder if it'll flush down the toilet?

00:02:54.450 --> 00:02:57.200
I think the rotten squid would get stuck, Takanashi-san.

00:02:57.200 --> 00:02:59.780
Yeah, it probably would.

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:01.660
Wait, how...?!

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:03.070
You didn't lock the door.

00:03:03.070 --> 00:03:04.200
Tch.

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:07.800
But really, why was there a rotten squid in your locker?

00:03:07.800 --> 00:03:09.810
It has to be harassment.

00:03:09.810 --> 00:03:12.920
Rotten squids are really smelly, as you can tell.

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:15.100
Oh my, that's terrible!

00:03:15.100 --> 00:03:17.170
You deserved it.

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:20.180
You're the bad one for keeping Mirei-sama all to yourself!

00:03:20.180 --> 00:03:21.260
Mirei-sama?

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:23.970
They're talking about me.

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:26.860
Is your name Mirei?

00:03:26.860 --> 00:03:28.960
No, my name is Rin.

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:30.140
Is it your last name, then?

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:31.570
My last name is Yatagai.

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:34.690
Get away from Mirei-sama!

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:36.480
What are you thinking?!

00:03:37.140 --> 00:03:41.490
You had Mirei-sama all to yourself in the morning, at lunch break, and even after school!

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:43.030
You shameless girl!

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:45.590
No, that only started yesterday.

00:03:45.590 --> 00:03:49.430
You're only concerned with your own pleasure, aren't you?

00:03:49.430 --> 00:03:50.560
That's a misunderstanding!

00:03:50.560 --> 00:03:52.920
She's just been following me around!

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:57.450
That's an awful thing to say!
"Following you around"? How terribly rude!

00:03:57.450 --> 00:03:58.880
Apologise to Mirei-sama!

00:03:59.290 --> 00:04:01.660
What? But...

00:04:01.660 --> 00:04:04.510
I'm sorry. I'm the one at fault.

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:06.380
Mirei-sama, you're innocent.

00:04:06.380 --> 00:04:08.510
This sneaky woman is to blame!

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:13.960
No, my existence itself is sinful, as it leads you astray.

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:17.520
I am very, very sorry.

00:04:18.510 --> 00:04:19.900
Even so...

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:22.190
...was the rotten squid really necessary?

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:24.150
Mirei-sama...

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:26.070
...please don't hate us!

00:04:28.690 --> 00:04:29.990
Bad girls.

00:04:29.990 --> 00:04:33.000
Mirei-sama!
Mirei-sama!

00:04:35.470 --> 00:04:36.710
Idiots.

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:38.540
Messiah-sama!

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:41.420
What is it, P-Princess?

00:04:41.730 --> 00:04:43.390
Call me Layla.

00:04:43.390 --> 00:04:45.870
L-Layla...

00:04:45.870 --> 00:04:49.300
<i>Messiah</i>? <i>Princess</i>? <i>Layla</i>? How old is she anyway?

00:04:49.300 --> 00:04:52.850
Shuu-chan, don't tell me you're getting into this!

00:04:52.850 --> 00:04:54.530
Now, let's hurry.

00:04:54.530 --> 00:04:56.210
Wh-What is it?

00:04:56.210 --> 00:05:00.950
You'll be learning proper speech and conduct as the Messiah, of course.

00:05:00.950 --> 00:05:02.690
We'll start by practicing speech.

00:05:02.690 --> 00:05:03.650
What?

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:06.450
The Messiah needs a good voice.

00:05:07.290 --> 00:05:09.240
Now, repeat after me.

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:13.160
A-E-I-O-U!

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:13.850
Go!

00:05:13.850 --> 00:05:17.330
Don't tell me to <i>go</i>! Everyone in school will hear me!

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:22.730
It's all right. A true messiah shouldn't be embarrassed no matter how embarrassing it may be.

00:05:22.730 --> 00:05:24.340
What kind of messed-up logic is that?

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:25.700
Throw away your common sense!

00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:31.640
But, well... you know? If we're too loud and get found by Clone-neesan...

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:33.760
There's no need to worry.

00:05:33.760 --> 00:05:36.060
Clone is captivated by a small bird at the moment.

00:05:36.330 --> 00:05:37.060
A small bird?

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:40.820
She must have let her guard down because I found you, Messiah.

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:45.270
Clone does not know that our first campaign is only two days away.

00:05:45.270 --> 00:05:46.280
First campaign?

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:48.820
The day of your public début!

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:50.380
My début!

00:05:50.380 --> 00:05:55.210
My début in the dazzling, secret, members-only club: Underworld!

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:59.600
Underworld is the best!

00:05:59.600 --> 00:06:01.130
Now, Messiah-sama!

00:06:01.130 --> 00:06:03.050
I'm ready!

00:06:03.050 --> 00:06:07.030
A-E-I-O-U!

00:06:07.030 --> 00:06:08.040
Ka-Ke-Ki-Ko-Ku!

00:06:08.040 --> 00:06:09.820
I don't get it.
Ka-Ke-Ki-Ko-Ku!

00:06:09.820 --> 00:06:09.880
Ka-Ke-Ki-Ko-Ku!

00:06:09.880 --> 00:06:10.780
What is that woman trying to do with Shuu-chan?

00:06:10.780 --> 00:06:14.100
Sa-Se-Si-So-Su!
What is that woman trying to do with Shuu-chan?

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:18.010
Well, my classroom is on the other side,

00:06:18.010 --> 00:06:22.530
and I'm not a masochist that gets turned on from a flick to the forehead,

00:06:22.530 --> 00:06:24.890
nor do I swing that way, so please excuse me.

00:06:24.890 --> 00:06:26.780
Well then, farewell.

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:28.530
Is that true?

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:32.530
You are clearly a masochist, Takanashi-san!

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:34.770
No, what are you talking about?

00:06:34.770 --> 00:06:36.220
Then, let me ask.

00:06:36.220 --> 00:06:39.340
What do you hope to accomplish by stalking your big brother?

00:06:39.340 --> 00:06:41.690
What do I hope to accomplish? That's...

00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:47.210
Enough with your daydreaming. I can imagine it for the most part.

00:06:47.210 --> 00:06:49.240
That is the forbidden fruit.

00:06:49.240 --> 00:06:52.150
A fleeting illusion that will never come true.

00:06:52.150 --> 00:06:56.110
If you understand that, yet are still completely devoted to your big brother,

00:06:56.110 --> 00:06:59.690
then Takanashi-san, you're none other than a masochist!

00:06:59.690 --> 00:07:02.690
Yes, you are an emotional masochist!

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:06.650
But that doesn't matter.

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:07.780
It doesn't?

00:07:08.070 --> 00:07:11.440
It seems my little sister won over your big brother,

00:07:11.440 --> 00:07:15.590
and for you, this is an excellent opportunity to take a new step.

00:07:15.590 --> 00:07:17.240
Stop pursuing the impossible.

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:20.590
Takanashi-san, you can call me Onee-sama!

00:07:20.590 --> 00:07:23.000
No, no, no! Senpai, you already have a lot of fans!

00:07:23.360 --> 00:07:25.670
You'll make a harem for yourself in no time!

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:28.560
I never asked for their frenzied attention.

00:07:28.560 --> 00:07:34.670
Of course, I don't exactly hate it, but I am not looking for fleeting pleasures.

00:07:34.670 --> 00:07:37.140
Shall we have lunch together?

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:41.080
I wonder what your big brother would think of you if he learned you've been stalking him.

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:42.900
That's a low blow!

00:07:42.900 --> 00:07:46.680
The first campaign is in two days. Is that right?

00:07:46.680 --> 00:07:48.190
I heard it with my own two ears.

00:07:48.190 --> 00:07:50.540
This came faster than expected.

00:07:50.540 --> 00:07:54.160
The forbidden underworld of ecstasy will open in two days!

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:55.410
Where is it?

00:07:55.410 --> 00:07:56.710
I don't know yet.

00:07:56.710 --> 00:07:58.080
We're counting on you, Messiah.

00:07:58.080 --> 00:08:01.080
Once we know the location, we can always slip in.

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:04.770
As for slipping in, Captain, one thing worries me.

00:08:04.770 --> 00:08:06.700
What is it, Messiah?

00:08:06.700 --> 00:08:11.900
I had speech lessons today to learn the mannerisms of a messiah.

00:08:11.900 --> 00:08:14.250
Does she mean we have to get into character completely?

00:08:14.250 --> 00:08:16.600
It must be a pretty serious club.

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:18.470
To slip in, we also have to...

00:08:22.850 --> 00:08:24.940
We'll get into character!

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:26.940
Yeah!

00:08:28.350 --> 00:08:29.880
I really don't want to go.

00:08:29.880 --> 00:08:32.710
Are your lips that special, Nao-chin?

00:08:32.710 --> 00:08:34.910
I think they're totally normal.

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:37.900
It must be something that only the experienced ones would understand!

00:08:37.900 --> 00:08:40.090
If you're feeling bad, why don't you just ignore her?

00:08:40.090 --> 00:08:44.670
Rather than do that and have her pick on you, it's better to just play along.

00:08:45.010 --> 00:08:49.960
Better or whatever, I have no choice. I'm up against an underhanded upperclassman.

00:08:51.520 --> 00:08:53.220
Oh well. I'll just go.

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:54.970
Good luck, Nao-chan!

00:08:55.310 --> 00:08:58.960
I'll be taking care of Shuu-chan!

00:09:00.250 --> 00:09:02.890
And here I have a black-hearted classmate.

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:08.870
Help yourself!

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:12.690
Do you have a splendid lunch like this every day?

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:16.200
It's a special treat for you, my cute Takanashi-san.

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:19.200
I shouldn't have asked!

00:09:27.530 --> 00:09:29.740
Now, please don't hold back.

00:09:29.740 --> 00:09:32.440
Then, let me...

00:09:53.690 --> 00:09:58.160
Senpai, um, are you not interested in boys?

00:09:58.160 --> 00:10:01.870
At the moment, I'm preoccupied with thoughts about preserving you in formaldehyde.

00:10:01.870 --> 00:10:03.370
What?!

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:05.120
The ultimate kiss.

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:06.160
Eh?

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:11.490
I'm looking for the ultimate kiss that can nullify any kind of magic!

00:10:11.490 --> 00:10:14.470
Men are creatures who chase that, right?

00:10:14.470 --> 00:10:16.550
That is why it has to be a girl.

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:20.910
Takanashi-san, your lips are wonderful in both size and shape.

00:10:20.910 --> 00:10:23.470
The more I look, the more I'm entranced by them.

00:10:24.760 --> 00:10:26.340
Let me do a test kiss.

00:10:26.340 --> 00:10:27.280
Wh-What are you...

00:10:27.280 --> 00:10:30.520
If it's not a good match, then we can always stop there.

00:10:30.520 --> 00:10:31.860
You can't do this!

00:10:38.600 --> 00:10:41.320
How about eating somewhere else from time to time?

00:10:41.320 --> 00:10:42.950
Oh? Why?

00:10:43.190 --> 00:10:45.030
Is it too cold?

00:10:45.030 --> 00:10:45.910
Eh?

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:48.750
Do you still have a fever? Is it tiresome to stay outside?

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:49.830
Fever?

00:10:50.760 --> 00:10:53.230
N-No, I don't have a fever any more.

00:10:53.230 --> 00:10:57.240
That's terrific! Please get over the cold soon and run my errands!

00:10:57.240 --> 00:10:58.930
Before things sell out.

00:10:58.930 --> 00:11:00.700
O-OK.

00:11:02.080 --> 00:11:05.260
I see now. He's keeping this relationship.

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:07.660
Shuu-chan, you're unexpectedly devious, faking an illness.

00:11:07.660 --> 00:11:10.140
And girls do tend to go for the bad boys!

00:11:10.430 --> 00:11:11.960
OK, let's eat.

00:11:11.960 --> 00:11:14.570
I brought some food that should give you energy.

00:11:14.850 --> 00:11:16.320
Whoa, she's here!

00:11:16.730 --> 00:11:19.240
Looks like your badness ends here, Shuu-chan!

00:11:19.550 --> 00:11:23.030
This is the end! Kondou will learn everything!

00:11:24.280 --> 00:11:26.730
Wh-What is she...

00:11:26.730 --> 00:11:28.870
She's trying to tell me something using telepathy!

00:11:29.400 --> 00:11:30.790
No problem.

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:34.210
Who I seek is the Messiah.

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:35.980
A boyfriend is not what I...

00:11:35.980 --> 00:11:36.960
Thank goodness she didn't make trouble.

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:39.490
Be confident as the Messiah!

00:11:39.490 --> 00:11:43.690
Warriors from all over the country will gather on the day of the decisive battle.

00:11:43.690 --> 00:11:46.720
Please don't embarrass me in front of them.

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:47.890
Y-Yes, sure.

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:51.710
Does this mean the patrons will be in a contest to show off their character performances?

00:11:51.710 --> 00:11:56.360
Underworld sounds like a demanding place.

00:11:56.360 --> 00:11:57.020
Nao!

00:11:58.440 --> 00:12:00.240
O-Onii-chan!

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:11.970
How much does Onii-chan know about Clone-neesan?

00:12:11.970 --> 00:12:14.530
What if he gets the wrong idea?

00:12:14.530 --> 00:12:17.380
You must really love your big brother.

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:21.550
Are you saving your first kiss for him?

00:12:26.010 --> 00:12:27.760
Wh-What do you mean?

00:12:27.760 --> 00:12:30.290
You're cute, Takanashi-san.

00:12:30.290 --> 00:12:34.090
I want to kiss your lips even more...

00:12:34.090 --> 00:12:36.100
...and at any cost.

00:12:46.390 --> 00:12:47.990
I'm home!

00:12:53.910 --> 00:12:56.120
This awkward atmosphere...

00:12:56.530 --> 00:13:00.130
There's no doubt about it! He knows about Clone-neesan's sexual orientation!

00:13:00.130 --> 00:13:04.470
Did Nao hear from Clone-neesan that I'm trying to get into the secret members-only club, Underworld?

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:07.230
He might be starting to think I became a lesbian!

00:13:07.230 --> 00:13:09.970
No, no! If I don't do something right now, I won't be able to redeem myself!

00:13:09.970 --> 00:13:12.060
Don't just stand there. Say something, Nao!

00:13:12.060 --> 00:13:13.230
I might throw up from all this tension!

00:13:13.230 --> 00:13:16.310
Please don't look at me as if you're disgusted by me, Onii-chan!

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:21.900
I-It's not what you think. It's not, Nao. This is... This is, you know...

00:13:22.730 --> 00:13:24.860
I heard we'll have curry for dinner!

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:27.080
Yay!

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:31.610
To overcome this situation,

00:13:31.610 --> 00:13:34.600
I must shake off Clone-neesan and resolve the misunderstanding with Onii-chan!

00:13:34.600 --> 00:13:37.800
It's just cosplaying. It's nothing I should feel guilty about!

00:13:37.800 --> 00:13:40.040
It's just that there's a little more skin showing!

00:13:42.400 --> 00:13:45.050
To overcome this situation...

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:51.680
You're showing great progress, Messiah-sama!

00:13:51.680 --> 00:13:55.560
My body moves by itself. It must be that my soul remembers it.

00:13:55.980 --> 00:13:56.690
What's this?

00:13:56.690 --> 00:13:57.560
Open it.

00:13:59.080 --> 00:14:00.560
Use it for the first campaign.

00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:06.240
I'm glad I met you!

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:12.620
You're the only one who can get into character without shame or honour!

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:16.560
Come on, Shuu-chan. You're engrossed by that toy sword!

00:14:16.560 --> 00:14:19.490
You're still an innocent young boy!

00:14:19.490 --> 00:14:22.060
But you have to grow up soon.

00:14:22.060 --> 00:14:24.190
Then, let's begin our intervention.

00:14:24.190 --> 00:14:28.850
Oh, Nao-chan. How's Clone-neesan? Is she well? Is it going OK?

00:14:28.850 --> 00:14:32.780
You don't have to worry about Shuu-chan. He's under my surveillance.

00:14:32.780 --> 00:14:33.520
See you!

00:14:34.990 --> 00:14:36.180
Wh-What's wrong?

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:37.640
Clone-neesan's too tenacious!

00:14:38.110 --> 00:14:41.660
Intervening here is the only way I can get away from her!

00:14:41.660 --> 00:14:43.180
I don't quite understand.

00:14:43.180 --> 00:14:44.220
Would you like to hear?

00:14:44.220 --> 00:14:45.280
Not really.

00:14:46.430 --> 00:14:49.620
What is it?! All right. Just tell me!

00:14:49.620 --> 00:14:53.510
Thanks, Iroha-chan. This is why everyone should have a friend.

00:14:53.520 --> 00:14:54.660
Eh...

00:14:55.660 --> 00:14:59.410
My lips with that person, then my lips with <i>that</i> person,

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:02.700
my lips and that person, my lips on that person,

00:15:02.700 --> 00:15:06.710
my lips to that person, my lips for that person,

00:15:06.710 --> 00:15:09.800
my lips, for that person,

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:12.510
that person, that person's!

00:15:14.550 --> 00:15:15.140
How was it?

00:15:15.840 --> 00:15:18.960
Do you understand my feelings for you?

00:15:18.960 --> 00:15:21.240
What? Um, well...

00:15:21.240 --> 00:15:24.330
Next will be... Yes, a song! I should sing a song!

00:15:24.330 --> 00:15:26.820
I'll give you a song of twining love!

00:15:27.150 --> 00:15:29.630
I'm sorry! Please give up on my lips–

00:15:29.630 --> 00:15:33.780
I'm not interested in something that I can get easily.

00:15:37.730 --> 00:15:38.720
Did you hear that?

00:15:38.720 --> 00:15:40.790
This is terrible beyond my imagination.

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:43.740
Isn't it? I have to put an end to this as soon as possible.

00:15:43.740 --> 00:15:46.280
My reasoning goes like this.

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:57.390
The question is how to intervene.

00:15:57.390 --> 00:16:01.560
Clone-neesan's been all over me, so I didn't have time to collect information.

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:03.940
So, that's why you'd like to join forces with me.

00:16:03.940 --> 00:16:06.100
Beggars can't be losers.

00:16:06.100 --> 00:16:08.330
It's "choosers", Nao-chan.

00:16:08.330 --> 00:16:09.940
Is there something we can use?

00:16:09.940 --> 00:16:12.450
Tyrol the Oracle.

00:16:13.250 --> 00:16:14.450
This is the time and location.

00:16:15.360 --> 00:16:18.050
I can't express my excitement in words.

00:16:18.050 --> 00:16:20.300
Well done, Shuusuke! Excellent work!

00:16:20.300 --> 00:16:22.030
Thank you very much, Captain.

00:16:22.030 --> 00:16:23.320
The day has finally come.

00:16:23.320 --> 00:16:28.170
Yes. Still, at 8:30? The business opens really early.

00:16:28.170 --> 00:16:30.020
There's probably an opening ceremony or something.

00:16:30.020 --> 00:16:30.960
Ah, I see.

00:16:31.380 --> 00:16:33.390
Are your costumes ready?

00:16:33.390 --> 00:16:35.340
We'll embarrass ourselves with half-assed costumes.

00:16:36.340 --> 00:16:38.970
Excellent! Have a good night's sleep tonight.

00:16:38.970 --> 00:16:41.070
Be there tomorrow. Don't be late!

00:16:41.070 --> 00:16:42.480
It's finally our first campaign!

00:16:42.760 --> 00:16:43.440
Yes!

00:16:44.560 --> 00:16:47.090
There's nothing indecent about Underworld.

00:16:47.090 --> 00:16:50.830
Your big brother is just a little more curious than other people!

00:16:50.830 --> 00:16:52.950
It'll all end tomorrow!

00:16:52.950 --> 00:16:54.950
OK, Nao?

00:16:55.440 --> 00:16:56.870
Princess Layla!

00:16:58.000 --> 00:16:59.490
Princess Layla!

00:16:59.490 --> 00:17:00.140
Who are you?

00:17:00.140 --> 00:17:03.620
I'm Tyroli, the elder sister of Tyrol the Oracle!

00:17:03.880 --> 00:17:05.000
Tyrol's elder sister?

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:07.580
You are mistaken.

00:17:07.580 --> 00:17:10.490
That messiah is not the true messiah.

00:17:10.490 --> 00:17:12.150
That's impossible!

00:17:12.150 --> 00:17:14.530
What is your reasoning behind that claim?

00:17:14.530 --> 00:17:19.510
It'll be bad if Clone notices this. I'll tell you the details tonight at <i>that</i> place.

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:24.170
I think that went well!

00:17:24.170 --> 00:17:27.180
All that's left is to tell her that Shuu-chan's not the messiah!

00:17:27.180 --> 00:17:28.060
Easy as pie!

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:31.010
Let's get another oracle. I want to do it, too!

00:17:31.010 --> 00:17:33.560
Princess will resume her search for the messiah,

00:17:33.560 --> 00:17:36.470
and Clone-nee-san will be busy trying to capture the princess!

00:17:36.470 --> 00:17:38.320
I'll be set free! Perfect!

00:17:38.760 --> 00:17:41.700
You're a bad girl, Takanashi-san.

00:17:43.020 --> 00:17:48.600
Mantora, Mantora, Mantora.

00:17:48.600 --> 00:17:48.880
Princess Layla!

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:50.380
Mantora, Man–

00:17:50.730 --> 00:17:51.390
Tyroli?

00:17:51.390 --> 00:17:54.010
Not quite. I am Tyrole.

00:17:54.010 --> 00:17:55.740
Tyrole?!

00:17:55.740 --> 00:17:57.140
I am the youngest sister.

00:17:57.140 --> 00:17:58.510
Tyroli's here...

00:17:58.510 --> 00:17:59.970
Princess Layla!

00:18:00.850 --> 00:18:04.640
Could it be there are other siblings named Tyrola or Tyrolo?

00:18:04.640 --> 00:18:05.470
There aren't!

00:18:05.470 --> 00:18:07.630
That aside, as for that messiah...

00:18:07.630 --> 00:18:10.480
That's right! What do you mean I am mistaken?

00:18:10.480 --> 00:18:12.840
The real messiah is someone else!

00:18:12.840 --> 00:18:15.440
You have taken the wrong path.

00:18:15.440 --> 00:18:17.120
That is impossible!

00:18:17.120 --> 00:18:20.350
Do you not trust the words of the oracles?

00:18:20.350 --> 00:18:22.200
Let me speak to Tyrol.

00:18:22.200 --> 00:18:23.200
What?

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:25.270
Where's Tyrol the Oracle?

00:18:25.270 --> 00:18:27.210
Tyrol? Tyrol?!

00:18:28.370 --> 00:18:29.930
What should I do in this situation?

00:18:29.930 --> 00:18:31.710
I... I am a better...

00:18:32.130 --> 00:18:36.200
I-I am a better oracle than Tyrol!

00:18:36.200 --> 00:18:37.300
I found you!

00:18:37.300 --> 00:18:38.690
Can't you trust my words?!

00:18:38.690 --> 00:18:40.460
She's beginning to sound weird.

00:18:40.460 --> 00:18:42.510
Time for your punishment, Takanashi-san.

00:18:43.050 --> 00:18:45.770
Just trust me!

00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:52.520
Wrong person?!

00:18:52.520 --> 00:18:53.770
Ew!

00:18:53.770 --> 00:18:55.780
But this feeling...

00:18:55.780 --> 00:18:57.150
What are you doing?

00:18:57.150 --> 00:18:59.780
Your lips!

00:19:01.640 --> 00:19:03.650
What are you doing, Iroha-chan?

00:19:03.650 --> 00:19:04.700
Hi!

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:09.110
That was quite amusing.

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:14.210
If you don't go save her soon, Clone will suck everything out of her.

00:19:16.370 --> 00:19:17.750
Iroha-chan!

00:19:20.720 --> 00:19:22.910
She's done for!

00:19:22.910 --> 00:19:26.850
One wrong step and that could've happened to me! Knock on wood!

00:19:26.850 --> 00:19:33.360
Thank you. I think I just found wonderful lips, thanks to your meddling in his business.

00:19:33.360 --> 00:19:37.820
Do you mean you'll stop interfering with my activities?

00:19:37.820 --> 00:19:39.610
I'll think about it.

00:19:46.010 --> 00:19:47.330
N-Nao-chan!

00:19:47.910 --> 00:19:50.080
Good luck, Iroha-chan!

00:19:51.270 --> 00:19:52.790
You witch!

00:19:53.620 --> 00:19:57.420
Tyroli and Tyrole... There sure are many uses for a cell phone.

00:19:57.420 --> 00:20:00.020
Could it be that you knew from the start?

00:20:00.020 --> 00:20:03.280
Well, Tyrol is an existence inside my head, after all.

00:20:03.280 --> 00:20:05.050
She has no sisters, older or younger.

00:20:05.050 --> 00:20:06.100
I'm sorry.

00:20:06.100 --> 00:20:09.220
It was to shake off Clone, correct?

00:20:11.180 --> 00:20:13.080
You accomplished your goal.

00:20:13.080 --> 00:20:15.490
Both you and Clone, that is.

00:20:15.490 --> 00:20:16.830
It's my turn next.

00:20:16.830 --> 00:20:18.400
What are you going to do with my big brother?

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:20.570
The fusion of fantasy and reality.

00:20:28.360 --> 00:20:30.620
The Messiah will finally make his début!

00:20:30.620 --> 00:20:35.990
I can't wait! He's the only one who can handle the costume I designed!

00:20:35.990 --> 00:20:38.350
Did you really not tell him about the original work at all?

00:20:38.350 --> 00:20:39.900
I didn't tell him, of course.

00:20:39.900 --> 00:20:40.630
Excuse me.

00:20:40.870 --> 00:20:41.800
Please sign this!

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:44.270
Just as the Messiah is bewildered by his fate,

00:20:44.270 --> 00:20:47.410
he'll have to be bewildered by this situation, otherwise it'll be no fun!

00:20:47.410 --> 00:20:48.150
Thank you very much!

00:20:48.150 --> 00:20:50.600
So, how's the story going to develop?

00:20:51.050 --> 00:20:54.260
The King of Destruction will actually be the Messiah's father.

00:20:54.260 --> 00:20:56.560
Then, is the Princess the Messiah's little sister?

00:20:56.890 --> 00:21:00.800
She'll keep gaining divine powers as a super-dimensional being.

00:21:00.800 --> 00:21:04.360
Having a god in the story is risky since you never know how it'll develop!

00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:08.450
If it gets too messy, we can always kill everyone off and say everything was a dream!

00:21:10.910 --> 00:21:13.540
Still, that Messiah-sama is running late...

00:21:14.710 --> 00:21:17.670
I told him to make sure not to be late.

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:18.460
What is it?

00:21:18.460 --> 00:21:21.550
I gave him the wrong address!

00:21:21.550 --> 00:21:24.340
That's why he isn't here yet.

00:21:24.970 --> 00:21:27.140
That's Underworld...

00:21:27.140 --> 00:21:32.070
This deserted stillness... Exactly what you'd expect from a secret club.

00:21:32.070 --> 00:21:33.990
Still, Shuusuke's late!

00:21:33.990 --> 00:21:35.080
Let's get changed first.

00:21:35.080 --> 00:21:37.050
There was a public restroom on the way here.

00:21:37.050 --> 00:21:39.150
Good. Let's go!

00:23:09.820 --> 00:23:11.960
Big brother's turn-ons observation diary.

00:23:15.110 --> 00:23:19.160
6:53 AM, the local police took big brother into custody.

00:23:19.700 --> 00:23:23.670
Apparently, he issued a challenge at a public transport facility in that attire.

00:23:24.250 --> 00:23:28.160
Mum went to pick him up, and big brother gave this excuse:
